OL,3,GNEWSAFunds for force to tackle stalking
OL,4,Aand violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has been given #2.59m in
OL,7,Fextra government funding to tackle
OL,8,Fstalking and child-to-parent violence.
OL,10,FThe Cleveland police area will get
OL,11,F#1.59m to spend on its Multi-Agency
OL,12,FStalking Intervention Programme, which
OL,13,Fdeals with complex cases.
OL,15,FThe office of the Police and Crime
OL,16,FCommissioner (PCC) for Cleveland said
OL,17,Fthe cash would help pay for triage of
OL,18,Freferrals, specialist psychological
OL,19,Fassessments, support for victims and
OL,20,Fintervention for perpetrators.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
