OL,3,GNEWSAFunds for force to tackle stalking
OL,4,Aand violence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rest of the money is going to the
OL,7,FChild to Parent Violence Programme, to
OL,8,Fpay for a specialist service dealing
OL,9,Fwith the issue, including staff
OL,10,Fdevelopment and intervention
OL,11,Fprogrammes.
